{
  "_note": "Hand-curated subset of SAP standard DDIC for the POC. Not exported from a live system: verify against SE11 / DD03L before relying on it. T001 is included in addition to the requested tables because company-code currency (T001-WAERS) is needed for EKBE/EKBZ-DMBTR.",
